{"pull": {"id": "number:19581", "number": 19581, "title": "KAFKA-18855: Slice API for MemoryRecords", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-04-28T09:17:09Z", "closed_at": "2025-05-08T06:02:26Z", "merged_at": "2025-05-08T06:02:26Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The PR adds `slice` API in `Records.java` and further implementation in\n`MemoryRecords`. With the addition of ShareFetch and it's support to\nread from TieredStorage, where ShareFetch might acquire subset of fetch\nbatches and TieredStorage emits MemoryRecords, hence a slice API is\nneeded for MemoryRecords as well to limit the bytes transferred (if\nsubset batches are acquired).\n\nMemoryRecords are sliced using `duplicate` and `slice` API of\nByteBuffer, which are backed by the original buffer itself hence no-copy\nis created rather position, limit and offset are changed as per the new\nposition and length.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Jun Rao\n <junrao@gmail.com>, Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19581"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}